Chef and Instant Noodles
Chef has invented 1-minute Instant Noodles. As the name suggests, each packet takes exactly 1 minute to cook.
Chef's restaurant has X stoves and only 1 packet can be cooked in a single stove at any minute.

How many customers can Chef serve in Y minutes if each customer orders exactly 1packet of noodles?

Input Format
The first and only line of input contains two space-separated integers 
X and 𝑌
X,Y — the number of stoves and the number of minutes, respectively.
Output Format
Print a single integer, the maximum number of customers Chef can serve in 𝑌 minutes
input
3 7
output
21
========
x,y=map(int,input().split())
print(x*y)
